From f8a36b083c6d2df510222ce82929de9d0b48aafa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:30:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] soc: sprd: support Orca platform peripherals

Add Orca pin control and register definitions, PCIe host/client support, and the platform variants needed by DMA, GPIO, mailbox, ADI, PMIC, eFuse, MMC and watchdog drivers. Keep their bindings and build entries with the corresponding implementations.
